# Two mirrors that face each other (docs/apps/raytrace.md, "Example scenes"): what stands between
# them is seen again and again, as far as a path's turns go.
camera target -0.35 0.45 -0.2 turn 68 tilt 15 far 1.5 lens 0.6
background colour 0.6 0.75 1 power 0.4
object Floor plane scale 4 colour 0.7 0.68 0.62
object "Left mirror" box kind mirror colour 0.92 0.94 0.96 size 0.04 1.6 4 place -1.22 0.8 0
object "Right mirror" box kind mirror colour 0.92 0.94 0.96 size 0.04 1.6 4 place 1.22 0.8 0
object Teapot /root/Models/teapot.obj fit 0.7 move -0.45 0 -0.35 colour 0.85 0.3 0.2
object Ball ball kind plastic colour 0.2 0.6 0.9 scale 0.4 place -0.5 0.2 0.35
light Light place 0.3 3 0.5 radius 0.2 power 30
